.TH WERKMEISTER-BUDGET 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-budget \- The scheduler's budget, the slots held and the features Waiting for room
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister budget\fR [command]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Shows the scheduler's budget and who is using it: the memory and CPUs a feature's containers may take in total (\fBbudget:\fR in \fB~/.werkmeister/config.yaml\fR, else the Docker engine's memory less 1 GiB and every CPU), the host\-load ceiling the PR gate waits under, whether a person's \fBfeature up\fR may preempt an autonomous run, the features holding a slot, and the features \fBWaiting\fR for room in the order they will start.
.PP
It reads only: with the host daemon up it asks the daemon for the queue, otherwise it reads \fB~/.werkmeister/scheduler/\fR itself.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister budget status
werkmeister budget status \-\-json
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
